# Docs First

- If a decision changes project direction, workflow boundaries, or source-of-truth rules, update `MANIFEST.md` and the affected docs before or together with code.
- Keep repository truth in files, not only in chat.
- Use `docs/documentation-standard.md` when creating or revising substantial docs.
- Keep substantial work represented in `tasks/`.
